<main class="wrap">
<div class="hazard"></div>

<section id="menu">
  <p class="kicker">Action RPG · Roguelike · Dungeon crawler</p>
  <h1>Scrapline<span>Requiem</span></h1>
  <p class="premise">Decades after the collapse, an automated facility under a ruined city has switched itself back on. Its machines are climbing out into the wasteland. Go down as a Scrapper, clear the rooms one by one, and shut down the control system in the Core Vault.</p>

  <h2>Choose your Scrapper</h2>
  <div class="roster" id="roster" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Scrapper"></div>
  <div class="start-row">
    <button class="primary" id="start" type="button">Begin descent</button>
    <p class="note" id="touch-note" hidden>Scrapline needs a keyboard and mouse. Open it on a computer to play.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="note" style="margin-top:14px">Every machine you destroy drops a weapon, and the tougher the machine, the rarer the drop (Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary). Some machines are born with a Scrapper ability: they glow in its color, hit harder to kill, and drop better loot. Watch for their warning marks.</p>

  <h2>Controls</h2>
  <dl class="keys">
    <div><dt><kbd>W</kbd><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd></dt><dd>Move</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>Mouse</kbd></dt><dd>Aim your weapon at the cursor</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>Left click</kbd></dt><dd>Attack with the equipped weapon (hold to keep attacking)</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>Right click</kbd></dt><dd>Use your Scrapper's special ability</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>E</kbd></dt><dd>Pick up a weapon, use the room exit, shut down the core</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>Q</kbd></dt><dd>Use the selected consumable</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>F</kbd></dt><dd>Swap between your two carried weapons</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>1</kbd><kbd>2</kbd><kbd>3</kbd></dt><dd>Select an inventory slot (4 to 6 if your pack is larger)</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>Space</kbd></dt><dd>Dodge in your current direction</dd></div>
    <div><dt><kbd>Esc</kbd></dt><dd>Pause or resume</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

<section id="stage" hidden>
  <div class="stage-bar">
    <button class="ghost" id="quit" type="button">← Scrapper select</button>
    <button class="ghost" id="mute" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Sound on</button>
  </div>
  <div class="frame">
    <canvas id="cv" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrapline: Requiem game screen"></canvas>
    <div class="overlay" id="ov" hidden>
      <h2 id="ov-title"></h2>
      <p id="ov-text"></p>
      <div class="stats" id="ov-stats"></div>
      <div class="btns"><button class="primary" id="ov-a" type="button"></button><button class="ghost" id="ov-b" type="button"></button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="hint">WASD move · mouse aim · left click attack · right click ability · E interact · F swap weapon · Q use item · Space dodge · Esc pause · M sound</p>
</section>
